      "notes": "As a noir-inspired puzzle game centred around pathology, this game features stylized, 2D hand-drawn artwork focused on forensic body examinations accompanied by textual descriptions.\r\n\r\nMedical Nudity and Forensic Visuals: Players examine deceased male and female victims on the autopsy table to look for clues. The bodies are depicted as anatomically natural but non-explicit (no genitalia are shown, and details like nipples are faint or minimized). This nudity is strictly medical, clinical, and non-sexual.\r\n\r\nViolence and Investigation: While players do not see or explore full crime scenes, the 2D hand-drawn art includes close-up depictions of injuries and medical examinations on the bodies. The gameplay focuses entirely on analytical puzzle-solving through these body visuals and written case descriptions.\r\n\r\nSensitive Narrative Themes: In keeping with the dark, gritty nature of the noir genre, the narrative investigations explore heavy adult themes through text. This includes storylines dealing with homicide, substance use, and cases involving sexual assault/rape. These elements serve as narrative backdrop and plot points for the forensic puzzles.\r\n\r\nWhat is NOT in the game: The game does not visually depict explicit sexual acts, graphic nudity, or the act of sexual violence itself."
